<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Form 1040-V (2025) - Page 2</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #000;
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 40px;
  }
  .header-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .header-bar .page-num {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  h1.title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  p.subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: normal;
    margin: 10px auto 25px auto;
    max-width: 750px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  h2.section-heading {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 21px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .columns {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  .column {
    flex: 1;
    border: 1px solid #333;
  }
  .column-header {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px 8px 8px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
  }
  .column-header h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .column-header .fees {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .column-body {
    padding: 10px 14px 14px 14px;
  }
  .column-body ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .column-body li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .divider-line {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 18px 0;
  }
  .payments-link {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 10px 0;
  }
  h2.mailing-heading {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 19px;
    margin: 10px 0 10px 0;
  }
  table.mailing {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }
  table.mailing th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  table.mailing th:first-child {
    border-right: 1px solid #000;
  }
  table.mailing td {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  table.mailing td:first-child {
    border-right: 1px solid #000;
    width: 45%;
  }
  table.mailing td.address {
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header-bar">
    <span>Form 1040-V (2025)</span>
    <span class="page-num">Page <span style="font-size:16px;">2</span></span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="title">Need to make a payment?</h1>

  <p class="subtitle">Save time by paying online. Paying online is convenient and secure.</p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">The IRS offers easy ways to electronically pay your taxes.</h2>

  <div class="columns">
    <div class="column">
      <div class="column-header">
        <h3>Use Your<br>Online Account</h3>
        <div class="fees">(no fees)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="column-body">
        <ul>
          <li>Go to <em>www.irs.gov/Account</em> to log in and make a payment.</li>
          <li>Make a tax payment online directly from your checking or savings account.</li>
          <li>View your balance, payment plan details and options, digital copies of certain notices, and more.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column">
      <div class="column-header">
        <h3>Pay by<br>Bank Account</h3>
        <div class="fees">(no fees)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="column-body">
        <ul>
          <li>Use Direct Pay online to make an individual tax payment from your checking or savings account without registration.</li>
          <li>Register for the Electronic Federal Tax Payment System (EFTPS) to make one-time or recurring payments from your checking or savings account.</li>
          <li>When you e-file with tax software or a tax professional, you can schedule an electronic funds withdrawal (EFW).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column">
      <div class="column-header">
        <h3>Pay by<br>Card</h3>
        <div class="fees">(processing fees apply)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="column-body">
        <ul>
          <li>Pay online or by phone.</li>
          <li>When e-filing, pay through tax preparation software.</li>
          <li>Processing fees go to a payment processor and limits apply. The IRS does not receive any fees.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider-line">
  <p class="payments-link">Go to <strong><em>www.irs.gov/Payments</em></strong> for more details or to make a payment.</p>
  <hr class="divider-line">

  <hr class="divider-line" style="margin-top: 40px;">
  <h2 class="mailing-heading">Mailing Address for Payments</h2>

  <table class="mailing">
    <tr>
      <th>IF you live in...</th>
      <th style="text-align:center;">THEN use this address to send in your payment...</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Alabama, Florida, Georgia, Louisiana, Mississippi, North Carolina, South Carolina, Tennessee, Texas</td>
      <td class="address">Internal Revenue Service<br>P.O. Box 1214<br>Charlotte, NC 28201-1214</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Alaska, Arizona, Arkansas, California, Colorado, Connecticut, Delaware, District of Columbia, Hawaii, Idaho, Illinois, Indiana, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Maine, Maryland, Massachusetts, Michigan, Minnesota, Missouri, Montana, Nebraska, Nevada, New Hampshire, New Jersey, New Mexico, New York, North Dakota, Ohio, Oklahoma, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, South Dakota, Utah, Vermont, Virginia, Washington, West Virginia, Wisconsin, Wyoming</td>
      <td class="address">Internal Revenue Service<br>P.O. Box 931000<br>Louisville, KY 40293-1000</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>A foreign country, American Samoa, or Puerto Rico (or are excluding income under Internal Revenue Code section 933), or use an APO or FPO address, or file Form 2555 or 4563, or are a dual-status alien or nonpermanent resident of Guam or the U.S. Virgin Islands</td>
      <td class="address">Internal Revenue Service<br>P.O. Box 1303<br>Charlotte, NC 28201-1303</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
```
